  "title": "Law of assumption sleep meditation · whispered ASMR, Neville Goddard (50 min)",
  "description": "A guided, whispered sleep meditation built on Neville Goddard's law of assumption: a short plain explanation, a few lines from the public-domain books, then a long, quiet stretch to fall asleep in the wish fulfilled.\nThe voice is AI: a clone of the creator's own whisper, made with Chatterbox. The facts come from checked public sources.\n50 min of soft whispering over dim, slow footage, no music.\n\nChapters\n0:00:00 An hour of Neville Goddard's law of assumption, whispered sl\n0:09:28 Gently settle into your bed now\n0:33:08 In Out of This World, Neville wrote this\n0:34:54 You are lying here in the quiet warmth of your bed\n\nTechniques from the public-domain writings of Neville Goddard (1905–1972).\nQuoted from: Out of This World (1949); Awakened Imagination (1954), public domain in the US.\nNot affiliated with or endorsed by any estate, publisher or organisation.\nA practice for rest and imagination, not a promise of any outcome.\n\nPicture credits\nFOOTAGE: 2526676 / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Alex_Jauk / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Bernhard_Schuermann / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: D-GM / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Iconikmg / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: JoshuaWoroniecki / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Kanenori / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Macb3t / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Mario_Krimer / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Matthias_Groeneveld / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Mixkit / MIXKIT\nFOOTAGE: Natures_Embrace / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: NickyPe / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: RobVanDerMeijden / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: Veniamin_Danchek / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: abele62 / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: adege / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: bellergy / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: crimea13 / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: immikhan06 / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: jrydertr / PIXABAY\nFOOTAGE: outlinez / PIXABAY\n\n#sleep #asmr #nevillegoddard #lawofassumption\n",
